nqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p033:m0156","mention_ids":["c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p033:m0156"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p034:m0000","mention_ids":["c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p034:m0000"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":3,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":3,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":2,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"3處獨立位置，3個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete-ws1748911"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"source_reading_cases":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:source_review33-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"lm0_qq0_pua","source_quote":"宕昌，羌種也。各有酋豪，領部眾汧、隴閒。宋末，宕昌王梁彌機為使持節、督河涼二州、安西將軍、東羌校尉、河涼二州刺史、隴西公。建元元年，太祖進號鎮西將軍。又征虜將軍、西涼州刺史羌王像舒彭亦進為持節、平西將軍。後叛降〔虜〕。永明元年，八座奏，前使持節、都督河涼二州軍事、鎮西將軍，東羌校尉、河涼二州刺史、隴西公、宕昌王梁彌機，前使持節、平北將軍、西涼州刺史、羌王像舒彭，竝著勤西垂，寧安邊境，可復先官爵。詔又可以隴右都帥羌王劉洛羊為輔國將軍。","reading":"羌總題載宕昌及其他羌王，梁彌機、像舒彭、劉洛羊各有官銜。","note":"羌總題載宕昌及其他羌王，梁彌機、像舒彭、劉洛羊各有官銜。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p033","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":218,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete-ws1748911"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-qi059-liang-miji-death","person_id":"lm0_qq0_pua","event_type":"death","source_term":"卒","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p034","start":1,"end":2,"surface":"卒"},"date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-059","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete-ws1748911","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p034","quote":"機卒。三年，詔曰：「行宕昌王梁彌頡，忠款內附，著績西服，宜加爵命，式隆蕃屏。可使持節、督河涼二州諸軍事、安西將軍、東羌校尉、河涼二州刺史、隴西公、宕昌王。」頡卒。六年，以行宕昌王梁彌承為使持節、督河涼二州諸軍事、安西將軍、東羌校尉、河涼二州刺史、宕昌王。使求軍儀及伎雜書，詔報曰：「知須軍儀等九種，竝非所愛。但軍器種甚多，致之未易。內伎不堪涉遠。祕閣圖書，例不外出。五經集注、論〔語〕，今特敕賜王各一部。」俗重虎皮，以之送死，國中以為貨。","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p034:m0000"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按同段人物與次第核所屬卒事。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p033:m0026","start":26,"end":29,"surface":"梁彌機","kind":"person","person_id":"lm0_qq0_pua","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p033","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p033:m0156","start":156,"end":159,"surface":"梁彌機","kind":"person","person_id":"lm0_qq0_pua","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p033","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p034:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"機","kind":"person","person_id":"lm0_qq0_pua","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p034","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[